[ARCHITECTURE ENHANCEMENT] Associative Triple Pre-Verification Gate & JSONL Telemetry
[DATE] 2026-08-13
[LAYER] C++ JNI Layer (`BrainJNI.cpp`)
[MECHANICS & PROVENANCE]
  1. **Associative Triple Pre-Verification Gate:**
     When open chit-chat triggers the neural predictor `think(4)`:
     - If the output forms an exact 3-word candidate triple (`p_subj`, `p_rel`, `p_obj`), the gate intercepts it.
     - Performs a case-normalized lookup against `b->brainql_engine.facts` (`to_lower(f.subj) == to_lower(p_subj)`).
